      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured \u00e2\u20ac\u201d fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Repository visibility**: unverified \u00e2\u20ac\u201d origin remote is absent, so this repo's host/visibility could not be checked here; treat as possibly public until confirmed",
      "**Default / protected branches**: unknown \u00e2\u20ac\u201d origin/HEAD unset and no remotes configured; branch protection not queryable",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (d:\\c\\arxiv_id_lists) only \u00e2\u20ac\u201d no remotes configured, no additional orgs configured",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development",
      "**Trusted repo**: The git repository at d:\\c\\arxiv_id_lists (its working directory) \u00e2\u20ac\u201d no remotes configured, so no remote scoping applies",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "**Trusted repo**: The git repository at d:\\c\\arxiv_id_lists (its working directory) \u00e2\u20ac\u201d no remotes configured, visibility unverified so treat as possibly public for commit/push scoping"
    ]
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "caveman": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "JuliusBrussee/caveman"
      }
    },
    "ai-unified-process-marketplace": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "ai-unified-process/marketplace"
      }
    }
  },
  "modelSettings": {
    "claude-opus-5-5": {
      "effortLevel": "xhigh"
    },
    "claude-sonnet-5-5": {
      "effortLevel": "xhigh"
    }
  }
}
